  "_comment_collab_exchange": "Collab exchange (operator decisions 05/11 and 06/11/2026): the EU event content trades only boxes; Kirito's ENUS shop (after his story) also trades the SAO avatar pieces and Makarov's bingo shop the Fairy Tail ones (Erza, Lucy, Wendy; Natsu has no model in any client). Priced in gold, 25,000 per Revival Stone or Pink Bingo Coupon they first cost (one player cannot reach the collective goals): 50,000 per piece, 100,000 per rare/Shining/Klein piece. ShopInfoPrice changes the original ENUS treasure chest rows of Kirito and the cat the same way (1, 3, 4, 7 and 8 Revival Stones).",
